Nothing from the image is committed; the tools below read it and skip when it is absent.
  udif2raw.py   in.dmg out.raw          rebuild the APFS partition from a UDIF dmg
  apfsdump.py   base.raw                independent read-only inspector: compressed inodes, decmpfs header, flags, xfields
  rsrc.py       base.raw [blocks.out]   resource-fork layout facts; optionally export every block for applevec
